      <title>1024程序节学习复盘</title>
      <link href="/posts/759850e3.html"/>
      <url>/posts/759850e3.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>今天跟着“1024程序员节”的课表开始学 Python。上午的进度虽然只推进了两节（复习基础语法 + 函数）为了防止自己“学了就忘”，我把上午的踩坑记录和知识理解整理了一下。</p></blockquote><h3 id="一、-被-while-和-break-折磨">一、 被 while 和 break 折磨</h3><p>今天写的第一个完整程序是“重启终端：<strong>口令 1024</strong>。代码虽然不长，但我调了好几次。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">check_count = <span class="number">0</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> check_count == <span class="number">3</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;今天打卡已上限，去休息吧&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    task = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入今天的学习内容(输入exit退出): &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> task == <span class="string">&quot;exit&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;终端已关闭&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> task == <span class="string">&quot;1024&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        check_count += <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;打卡成功，当前已打卡<span class="subst">&#123;check_count&#125;</span>/3个。&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;-&quot;</span> * <span class="number">20</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>最后那句可以不写的,就是看起来更美观一点</p></blockquote><p>给自己记下的两个教训：</p><ol><li><strong>check_count = 0</strong> 必须写在 while 外面！ 我今天才彻底搞懂，如果把这个记分牌写在 while 里面，每次循环一开始，分数就被强行清零了，永远也攒不够 3 次。</li><li>不加 break 就是无尽折磨。 while True 是个无底洞，如果我不写 break 去结束它，即使输入了 <strong>exit</strong> ，程序也会继续问我“请输入今日学习内容”。</li></ol><h3 id="二、-懂了，但没完全懂的函数（参数和返回值）">二、 懂了，但没完全懂的函数（参数和返回值）</h3><p>上午重点学了 <strong>def</strong> 定义函数。我把函数整合到了打卡器里，写了进阶版的代码：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">calculate_exp</span>(<span class="params">times</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    base_exp = times * <span class="number">10</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> times &gt;= <span class="number">3</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        base_exp += <span class="number">50</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> base_exp</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># ... 这里为了方便省略了while循环，主程序是前面标题一的那个代码 ...</span></span><br><span class="line">        my_exp = calculate_exp(check_count)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;获得经验值：<span class="subst">&#123;my_exp&#125;</span> 点！&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong><em>脑补</em></strong>：<strong>print</strong> 和 <strong>return</strong> 到底差在哪？<br>这是上午最卡我的地方。我还以为写个函数让它打印出来就完事了，今天才明白：</p><ul><li><strong>return</strong> 是交还结果：函数算完账，用 return 把数据悄悄塞回给外面的变量（my_exp），这一步在屏幕上是看不见的。</li><li><strong>print</strong> 只是让你看个响：外面拿到了 my_exp 这个数据后，我再写个 print，屏幕上才会出现“获得经验值”。</li><li><strong>总结</strong> ：没 return，外面的程序就接不到数据；没 print，我就看不到结果。</li></ul><h3 id="三、-实战做题：">三、 实战做题：</h3><p>上午做了一道限时题：算算距离 1024 经验差多少，如果超额了就输出 0，且要求不要打印任何提示语。<br>我提交的正确代码：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">n = <span class="built_in">int</span>(<span class="built_in">input</span>())</span><br><span class="line">diff = <span class="number">1024</span> - n * <span class="number">32</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> diff &gt; <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(diff)</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行时我的翻车操作：<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>输入空回车会死机</strong> ：我运行测试的时候手欠，直接按了回车，结果报错，具体它写的什么不记得，但是大概意思就是：int( ) 遇到空字符串（空气）直接罢工了。以后测试这种题，千万不能习惯性乱按回车。<br><strong>2.</strong> <strong>不要乱加提示语</strong>：平时习惯写 input(“请输入…”)，但是系统是个瞎子😂，它只认纯数字。<br><strong>3.</strong> <strong>逻辑差点写反</strong>：差值是 1024 - 得分。如果超额完成，这个差值就是负数。所以判断是否输出 0，条件是 if diff &lt;= 0 或者像上面那样 if diff &gt; 0 走正常流程。看别人代码时，发现有人写成了 if diff &gt;= 1024，逻辑直接就绕进去了。</p><h3 id="四、数据结构：把数据管起来（列表与字典）">四、数据结构：把数据管起来（列表与字典）</h3><p>下午学了字典（<strong>Dict</strong>）和列表（<strong>List</strong>）</p><ul><li>字典：用大括号 { } 包起来，左边是键（<strong>Key</strong>），右边是值（<strong>Value</strong>）。</li><li>我犯的错：一开始把年龄写成了 ‘year’ : ‘19’（加了引号变成了字符串）。以后要是拿年龄做加减法计算，绝对会报错，数字千万别加引号。<br>先看一段最基础的代码，感受一下：</li></ul><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. 创建一个字典</span></span><br><span class="line">player = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;myrvyn&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;year&#x27;</span>: <span class="number">19</span>,   <span class="comment">#我就是这里写错了😅不要加引号！</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;hobby&#x27;</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;敲代码&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2. 读取：通过键名取值</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(player[<span class="string">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>])    <span class="comment"># 输出：myrvyn</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3. 修改：直接给键重新赋值</span></span><br><span class="line">player[<span class="string">&#x27;year&#x27;</span>] = <span class="number">20</span>      <span class="comment"># 年龄改成20岁</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(player[<span class="string">&#x27;year&#x27;</span>])    <span class="comment"># 输出：20</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>我觉得字典最强大的地方在于，它能用一个“名字（键）”直接找到对应的“东西（值）”。而且它是可变对象，我们可以随时修改里面的数据，这在做身份卡、存用户信息时非常方便。</p><h4 id="菜单循环与功能拆分">菜单循环与功能拆分</h4><p>然后这是我课上写的代码分解：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. 用字典存储个人身份信息</span></span><br><span class="line">my_info = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;myrvyn&#x27;</span>,</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;year&#x27;</span>: <span class="number">19</span>,</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;hobby&#x27;</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;敲代码&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>为什么 <strong><em>my_info</em></strong> 要写在外面？<br>因为它是“全局”的数据。</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2. 功能函数：封装展示个人名片的逻辑</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">show_card</span>(<span class="params">info_dict</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span> + <span class="string">&quot;=&quot;</span> * <span class="number">25</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;【个人信息卡片】&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;昵称:<span class="subst">&#123;info_dict[<span class="string">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>]&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;年龄:<span class="subst">&#123;info_dict[<span class="string">&#x27;year&#x27;</span>]&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;爱好:<span class="subst">&#123;info_dict[<span class="string">&#x27;hobby&#x27;</span>]&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;=&quot;</span> * <span class="number">25</span> + <span class="string">&quot;\n&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>为什么要单独写一个 <strong><em>show_card</em></strong> 函数？<br>因为不封装成函数，每次用户输入 <em>check</em> ，我们都要把上面这几行 print 重新写一遍。封装成函数后，主程序里只要一句 show_card(my_info) 就能直接调用，代码更干净。这就叫“封装”。</p></blockquote><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3. 主程序：命令行交互循环</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;(提示: 输入1024打卡, 输入check查看身份, 输入exit退出)&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">while</span> <span class="literal">True</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    user_input = <span class="built_in">input</span>(<span class="string">&quot;请输入指令: &quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># 路由分发：根据不同的指令执行不同的操作</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> user_input == <span class="string">&quot;exit&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;终端已关闭。&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">break</span>  <span class="comment"># 退出无限循环</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">elif</span> user_input == <span class="string">&quot;1024&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;打卡成功,经验值+1&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">elif</span> user_input == <span class="string">&quot;check&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        show_card(my_info)  <span class="comment"># 调用函数，传入字典</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">else</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;未知指令,请重新输入&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><em>看着这三段代码，最大的感受就是“逻辑其实不难，就是把生活搬进代码里”。字典就是我的身份档案，函数就是我的展示卡片动作，while 循环就是我在等你跟我说话。</em></p><blockquote><p>讲讲 <strong><em>while True</em></strong> 的感觉。就是可以比喻说：“这就好比我开了一家店，只要顾客没喊 <strong><em>exit</em></strong>（关门），我就一直坐在这里等他们输入指令。”</p></blockquote><h4 id="列表（简洁了一点）：">列表（简洁了一点）：</h4><p><code>在代码分解1里面，最后一个代码后面，加上 'skills': ['Python', '写代码', '找Bug']。在“代码分解2”里面倒数第二行，加上 print(f&quot;技能:&#123;info_dict['skills']&#125;&quot;)。</code><br><strong>理解</strong> ：为什么要在字典里塞一个列表？</p><ul><li>在写“个人信息卡片”的时候，我发现“爱好”通常只有一个（比如敲代码），用字符串就够了。但是“技能”往往有多个。</li><li>如果我把技能写成 ‘skills’: ‘Python, 写代码, 找Bug’，它本质上还是一个长字符串，以后如果我想单独把 <strong>Python</strong> 挑出来，就很麻烦。</li><li>所以我用了一个列表 [‘Python’, ‘写代码’, ‘找Bug’] 作为字典的值。这就是今天学到的（字典套列表）。当程序打印 info_dict[‘skills’] 的时候，它会原封不动地把整个列表展示出来。这样写，方便以后随时添加新技能。</li></ul>]]></content>
      
      
      
